// E3.C US-008: chaos wiring. The operator binary that performs a manifest
// `chaos` block's injection (bin/tt-chaos), and the chaos.log the operator
// appends to — the oracle-evidence-snapshot copies it into the immutable
// oracle snapshot under the chaos_log evidence key (US-003) so O4's watchdog
// false-positive check and O16 can cross-reference. TT_CONTROLLER_TT_CHAOS_PATH
// overrides the binary for hermetic tests (mirrors
