// E3.C US-006: the targeted O9 probe operator (bin/o9-targeted-probes.mjs).
// TT_CONTROLLER_O9_PROBES_PATH overrides the executable for hermetic tests
// (mirrors TT_CONTROLLER_DAEMON_CONTROL_PATH / TT_CONTROLLER_TT_CHAOS_PATH) —
// the S16 (US-004) sweep test injects a garbage-emitting probe stub through
// this seam so runCaseO9TargetedProbes' JSON.parse-of-stdout hardening is
